<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 90,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 90,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday est receipts totaled 90,000, Wk ago 97,000, and Yr ago 96,000. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady to firm compared with mid-session Monday. Trade was slow to moderate for moderate demand and light offerings. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
